                                "sense_id": "fd63f4f9-d846-3911-9b2e-40741420e1c1",
                                "text": "Being a large commercial place, he here expects to behold all the happy effects of the new constitution; he congratulates himself on travelling at a period when he can procure information, and discuss his political opinions, unannoyed by fears of state prisons, and spies of the police."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8ea7e70f-7fc9-49b0-b31c-fab89f907b41",
                                "sense_id": "fd63f4f9-d846-3911-9b2e-40741420e1c1",
                                "text": "He has loafed, seen the country and green things, laughed in joy, lain on his back and listened to the birds singing overhead, unannoyed by factory whistles and bosses' harsh commands; and, most significant of all, he has lived!"
